# Filtration of a representation
%%%
tag := "Chapter3/Definition3.4.1"
number := false
%%%
**Definition 3.4.1.** A (finite) **filtration** of $`V` is a sequence of subrepresentations $`0 = V_0 \subset V_1 \subset \cdots \subset V_n = V`.

